{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1498510-should-vampires-growl","id":1498510,"title":"Should vampires growl?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-12-01T01:11:47-08:00","id":1498510,"title":"Should vampires growl?","content":"It's kind of a thing with vampires in fiction, the hissing or the buffverse vamps and their growling/snarling. Some people seem to just by default think it's a innate feature of vampires and like it as a way to highlight their inhumanity and predatory nature, which is fine and I also kind of like that aspect of it, though I don't use it. I was wondering if others had vampires growl in their own games?<br /> <br /> Personally, I don't actually picture the Kindred doing that. Except for maybe the Gangrel, who may develop growling or hissing or whatever as a tic/mutation due to their curse. Setites may also perform a snake-like hiss, but that would be a deliberate action on their part. Vampires, in my mind, are stuck with human vocalizations when they make noise. We also hiss and can make a sort of guttural &quot;ugh&quot; noise when angry, so they do hiss/growl, but not in any inhuman way. In certain circumstances they may also produce a sort of &quot;angry death rattle.&quot; But the beast itself doesn't bother with vocalizing. When I picture a wight I imagine something that's unmistakably a cannibalistic walking corpse. Wights and vampires in frenzy don't use their atrophied lungs, they don't make noise. The concept of being stalked through the night by some utterly silent, still, ravenous dead thing is something I find more unsettling than a snarling animal in human skin.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><sup><i>Prone to hyperbole</i></sup>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","name":"Rhywbeth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T12:07:24-08:00","id":1498559,"title":"","content":"I never used the growling thing at all myself even with my Brujah characters at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T12:37:42-08:00","id":1498565,"title":"","content":"I like how in &quot;Blade&quot; vampires will pronounce random syllables in a deep, inhuman, near growl way. I use that in games occasionally, like having a messy crit or succeed-at-a-cost on a social roll be that the character pronounced a syllable or two in a deep, inhuman, quasi-growl.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T14:23:04-08:00","id":1498577,"title":"","content":"in the world of darkness setting I would say yes mainly because vampires have a beast in their souls.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27369-the-smiling-gun-knight","name":"The smiling gun-knight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T15:07:55-08:00","id":1498578,"title":"","content":"Well it was either that or mewing, and the latter got creepy real fast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T15:25:21-08:00","id":1498579,"title":"","content":"I tend to go for a hiss. Methusulahs sound like the alien queen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T15:40:07-08:00","id":1498581,"title":"","content":"Personally I feel like they would be creepier if the did the Heat Ledger joker lips tick thing, sorta like they are salivating before getting the juice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T16:48:20-08:00","id":1498584,"title":"","content":"I've never done it or seen it done at the gaming table. I don't see any problems though if people wanted to roleplay that. I would associate such moments to occur when the game would require a Frenzy or Rotschreck roll when the Beast is provoked in game, or possibly when the vampire feeds.<br /> <br /> I have the feeling though more often than not, actually growling (as opposed to the player narrating it, &quot;my character growls in anger&quot;) during play would often seem silly rather than dramatic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","user":"Black Fox","date":". 12-01-2022, 07:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-02T12:29:52-08:00","id":1498628,"title":"","content":"Dread Gaze's text (up to V20) suggests that hissing and/or growling is something that a vampire can attempt to show off their nature, but I haven't seen it much in actual play. I guess that it's not the most common way to implement that power and it's mostly done in that specific context; other growlers/hissers may include some Gangrels, Setites and Nosferatu, a few followers of the Road of Beast and derived Paths, and occasionally some Kindreds in frenzy while frustrated.<br /> <br /> I approve heartily of your idea of eerily silent wights.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1866-ophion","name":"Ophion","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-04T04:29:59-08:00","id":1498749,"title":"","content":"No. <br /> When not in frenzy, the Man is in control of the Beast, and the Beast has no influence. <br /> <br /> When in Frenzy, the Beast just cares about survival: Growling doesn't aid survival. The frenzied vampire will either be silent, or they might shout/scream to panic whoever they're trying to bite into.<br /> <br /> Dread gaze requires at least a hiss. <br /> Gangrel/Malkavians/Maeghar/the insane might have quirks that can cause growling but that's not really applicable to most vampires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T09:29:45-08:00","id":1499071,"title":"","content":"Humanity 1 do or at least that is how I interpretate it.<br /> <br /> However one thing is important, vampire must be functional otherwise the masquerade does not make sense.<br /> <br /> The beast does not make you a monsters, you messing up things is what makes the beast go out because your survival instincts activate taken up to eleven.<br /> <br /> The beast takes hold on you when you don\u00b4t feed enought, are injured, have a harsh discusion with someone you care etc... But if you are well feed and a more or less safe enviroments wich is 99% of the time you will do well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/cicerondixit/gallery\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/cicerondixit/gallery</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24037-leandro16","name":"Leandro16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24037_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-08T11:32:36-08:00","id":1499153,"title":"","content":"A lot of the artwork has hissing vamps, so I've always assumed they do.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1498510-should-vampires-growl?p=1498565#post1498565\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like how in &amp;quot;Blade&amp;quot; vampires will pronounce random syllables in a deep, inhuman, near growl way. I use that in games occasionally, like having a messy crit or succeed-at-a-cost on a social roll be that the character pronounced a syllable or two in a deep, inhuman, quasi-growl.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also, I love this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}